[gd_scene load_steps=14 format=3]

; zone_broken_gate — the last field map (WLD-05), band 15–19.
;
; The third field map, and deliberately the third shape. The Approach is a corridor you are
; pushed along and the Vale Floor is a basin you choose a line across; this one is a wall you
; have to get through. Everything is arranged around a single north–south curtain wall with
; two ways past it: the arch in the middle, and a collapsed stretch in the north that costs
; a detour. Two yards, one barrier, and the decision is which gap to take.
;
; The wall is what makes the camps readable. West of it the breakers hold the open ground;
; the wall line itself is archers and a bulwark, so pushing the arch head-on is the expensive
; way in; the cinder row waits in the inner yard, which is the part the player only sees once
; they are already committed.

