; -- The curtain wall ----------------------------------------------------------
; Runs north-south at x = 0. Eight-metre segments, rotated a quarter turn so they run along
; z rather than x, laid end to end from one cliff to the other. Two gaps and nothing else:
; the arch at the centre, and the collapsed stretch between z = -34 and z = -22.

