; -- The arch and its towers ----------------------------------------------------
; The gap between WallN7 and WallS1 is ten metres wide, and the arch fills five of them.
; Narrow on purpose: this is the expensive way through, and it has to feel like a doorway
; rather than a missing piece of wall. The towers stand on the wall ends flanking it, and
; are tall enough to be picked out from the far side of either yard — this is the landmark
; the map is named for, and it has to be findable from anywhere on it.

[node name="Arch" type="StaticBody3D" parent="NavigationRegion3D"]
transform = Transform3D(0, 0, -1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, -1)
script = ExtResource("3_kit")
PieceId = "kit_gate"

